OL,3,CCount Binface: Who is the man behind
OL,4,Cthe bin?
OL,6,FCount Binface came second in the
OL,7,FClacton-on-Sea by-election against
OL,8,FNigel Farage after the Reform UK
OL,9,Fleader won the seat again.
OL,11,FThe novelty candidate threw his large,
OL,12,Fmetal hat into the ring after Farage
OL,13,Fannounced that he would resign and
OL,14,Fseek re-election due to growing
OL,15,Fscrutiny over financial support he
OL,16,Fallegedly failed to declare.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
