OL,3,CCount Binface: Who is the man behind
OL,4,Cthe bin?
OL,6,FThe Clacton result marks one of the
OL,7,Fbest results for the comedic
OL,8,Fpolitician, securing 9,455 votes
OL,9,Fcompared to his 95 votes in the
OL,10,FMakerfield by-election which saw Andy
OL,11,FBurnham return to Westminster.
OL,13,FBinface said: "I've had over 9,000
OL,14,Fvotes, guys. In Makerfield, eight
OL,15,Fweeks ago, I got 95 votes.
OL,17,F"So against Nigel Farage, compared to
OL,18,FAndy Burnham, I am 1,000 times more
OL,19,Fpopular."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
