OL,3,CCount Binface: Who is the man behind
OL,4,Cthe bin?
OL,6,FSo, who is Count Binface and what is
OL,7,Fhe all about?
OL,9,FWho is Count Binface?
OL,11,FCount Binface, an "intergalactic space
OL,12,Fwarrior and leader of the Recyclons
OL,13,Ffrom planet Sigma IX", is the alter
OL,14,Fego of comedian Jon Harvey.
OL,16,FHe campaigns wearing a black and grey
OL,17,Foutfit, a long silver cape and a
OL,18,Fhelmet resembling a dustbin.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
