OL,3,CCount Binface: Who is the man behind
OL,4,Cthe bin?
OL,6,FThe comedian, writer and producer
OL,7,Ffirst joined the political world at
OL,8,Fthe 2017 general election, standing
OL,9,Fagainst former Prime Minister Theresa
OL,10,FMay in Maidenhead under the name Lord
OL,11,FBuckethead.
OL,13,FSince then, he has challenged a string
OL,14,Fof high-profile politicians, including
OL,15,FBoris Johnson in Uxbridge and South
OL,16,FRuislip, Rishi Sunak in Richmond and
OL,17,FNorthallerton, and has twice stood in
OL,18,Fthe London mayoral elections.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
