OL,3,CCount Binface: Who is the man behind
OL,4,Cthe bin?
OL,6,FHis best result came in the 2021
OL,7,FLondon mayoral election, when he
OL,8,Freceived 92,896 votes and finished
OL,9,Fninth out of 20 candidates.
OL,11,FOutside of his work as Count Binface,
OL,12,FHarvey has written for a number of
OL,13,Fcomedy and satire programmes, such as
OL,14,FHave I Got News for You and The
OL,15,FRevolution Will Be Televised.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
