OL,3,CCount Binface: Who is the man behind
OL,4,Cthe bin?
OL,6,FWhat are his policies?
OL,8,FBinface typically launches a new
OL,9,Fmanifesto for each election he
OL,10,Fpartakes in.
OL,12,FSome of the pledges he made in Clacton
OL,13,Fare:
OL,15,FLike past campaigns, many of Count
OL,16,FBinface's policies are intentionally
OL,17,Ffunny, combining satire with
OL,18,Fcommentary on the cost of living and
OL,19,FBritish politics.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
