OL,3,CCount Binface: Who is the man behind
OL,4,Cthe bin?
OL,6,FHe also said his main appeal to voters
OL,7,Fwas that he was not "Nigel Farage".
OL,9,FWhen will we see him again?
OL,11,FThis has been one of the most high
OL,12,Fprofile campaigns for Binface after
OL,13,Fnone of the main parties entered a
OL,14,Fcandidate.
OL,16,FFarage accused Binface of being the
OL,17,F"establishment" candidate as he was
OL,18,Fthe main challenger to the Reform
OL,19,Fleader.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
