PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786753075
OL,3,CCount Binface: Who is the man behind
OL,4,Cthe bin?
OL,6,FIf he is found to have broken the
OL,7,Frules, he could face suspension and if
OL,8,Fthis lasts for longer than 10 days, a
OL,9,Frecall petition can be triggered in
OL,10,Fthat MP's constituency, which would
OL,11,Fmean another by-election for Clacton.
OL,13,FBinface appeared to confirm he would
OL,14,Fstand in Clacton again and told
OL,15,Freporters: "Let's all meet for part
OL,16,Ftwo of the Clacton by-election. Coming
OL,17,Fsoon to the leisure centre near you."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
